Ceder root: licences

Each folder in this repository carries its own licence, in a LICENSE file in
that folder. There is no single licence for the whole repository.

Folder                                   Licence      Where
---------------------------------------  -----------  ----------------------------------
bank/subjects/                           CC BY 4.0    bank/subjects/LICENSE
bank/tools/, bank/pipeline/,
  bank/schema/                           MIT          LICENSE in each of those folders
bank/tools/fonts/                        DejaVu fonts licence
                                                      bank/tools/fonts/LICENSE.txt
sources/                                 CC0 1.0      sources/LICENSE
share-alike/                             CC BY-SA 4.0 share-alike/LICENSE

CC BY 4.0, CC BY-SA 4.0 and CC0 1.0 are Creative Commons licences. The MIT
code carries the line "Copyright (c) 2026 Ceder".

Nothing in bank/subjects/ may be adapted from a share-alike source; such work
goes in share-alike/. This is not legal advice.
